{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:c2b2ed07bce59189edc8a5818f30ec742f6b6fba499b07b87c0d893138e7e18c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa9df107c1e647b54e7bae9f7c1661b96e456a42d42a1af893a04ce25971f647",
      "text": "幼小之人的来袭",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6dbc634bf248be7047423063ad4656c7174cee96d7a312973f503dec9704b5cd",
      "text": "制作人接到了一通电话。\n那是原本今天休息的阿斯兰打来的。\n不仅如此，内容还是求救信号……\n赶往阿斯兰所在的Cafe Parade后，\n那里却有一个素不相识的孩子……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000006:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000006:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa9df107c1e647b54e7bae9f7c1661b96e456a42d42a1af893a04ce25971f647",
      "text": "幼小之人的来袭",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d47f869448430103f305409673938dc818a5ba9fb8bd8b97419ec48ddd9a98ae",
      "text": "……咦，电话响了。\n喂？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9d7821192f089774f50b0fb575c0ff578c159479f56f3cf83e2a9eade12fae8",
      "text": "啊，吾主……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84f283bbfa16b0e47188b9ca33eeb57113a3bf77c2bb376488a823fe617880ea",
      "text": "这声音，是阿斯兰先生吧。\n今天应该是休息日，怎么了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb8877303ed395fe3b5126235f81955acb34f4a4367fdc3f16ce1ef534dd8e9c",
      "text": "那、那个……吾……\n救、救救吾……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c83b90927b10f36d0caacac8d3fbc6052dc2d0bf67fab167ca33b6b8b8a0147",
      "text": "哎！？您现在在哪里？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcd0047b5eed991611c2a57ef22d127aa7c3268d7cb8be454661df89a2d692a0",
      "text": "吾现在藏身于圣域之中……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d77154ac2e78b4bdd2ea0e5a71fa8cf23e9616586e00100cdff116a1396900b5",
      "text": "唔！那家伙的气息越来越强了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e3e682e89d8ea13f13e54fcc1a629ada0fd08517491a32996536217afe29ee1",
      "text": "汝方为留存予吾之最后的希望。\n拜托了，吾主……！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d56be9a092192779e8f682c4fa09058f1272c4d60cc48588dcbb1d6745140a2",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生……阿斯兰先生！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_a:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b3ec3183865185bea7c84d21c698cafe16d271c9508e03e8625c8174953130e0",
      "text": "（说到圣域……是那个地方吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d6b143ca38e6dcb64a769bf0761a944835be4f8863123a830c38c9b7a2067d5",
      "text": "怎么了，阿斯兰先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fbb89e9927756546c3e6abf94b9b061e3f90d353e2109bd13882565ba5fbb873",
      "text": "噢噢……吾主，汝来了吗！\n汝之救援之手，吾由衷感激！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d59f2882d9804ec8944de8a917570a2d67ad8c92944b9e19780afef3097c0cbe",
      "text": "你好——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a07bec46f2c7e42be945dd5b1008388da97f7e1cecb6df9b46d00aa9cbeb75",
      "text": "你好！……等等，咦？阿斯兰先生，\n这个元气满满的孩子是怎么回事？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:85c7989be4e95e58b1dcb47a25ffac376de325c5519dc5fe3cbc9fe1d90f69b1",
      "text": "唔、嗯……恐是，迷途之子吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d50869db32ca6e32bd9101f80f635a6d8b202e3c25a4cc41a005fd7ced2437fd",
      "text": "当吾为准备今宵之食粮，\n开启封印之门扉时，这幼小之人便在那里。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:486f7c183e36c356047b30535d8bc236ee1e986dacd19bcf3805a89764234328",
      "text": "虽向守护者们之要塞派遣了使魔，\n却毫无反应……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:afa36943a0b8d8b27dd3a304beff4caa0ff2363097d0e2dc9e9b485df47177a3",
      "text": "吾便思索着，唯有向主派遣使魔了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fe40fcdc68f29d2c63a18a20a57c3555b2cb1ef87a9c1f1ce965f86615a64cb",
      "text": "（守护者们的要塞……是派出所吗？\n这么说来，是打了电话的意思吧）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f7aea4e30414e70d00e87918b0dfb2986a445f4016b5ab4cae7e515ccee4213",
      "text": "原来如此，是这么回事啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27449c57c27190cd14b2c345667136431007bb344a18cffe7c93cf023e8938ad",
      "text": "父母一定会很担心的，\n我们再联系一次派出所看看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd9dca512d58e6a6f8073502eb44e384227dbebbb2660c0f577546d88374ad6",
      "text": "……电话打不通呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:10022ed290e3958d27d1ef6712901c74db832f82540772b30aa4b1c68407c61a",
      "text": "唔……守护者们尚未归来吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1579e77143cdff37a484bd910b3ab9df21580f9eaa2227ed425c06d564f527d2",
      "text": "就算由我们去找父母，\n不知道外貌特征也很难办呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebabea1868073f5ddc9bc56610ced825263391267df8221e7c4179d9b6eb6a76",
      "text": "不过如果是在这附近走散的话，\n也许会有人来接。先观察一下情况吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:003d242a8f1631d2a5291f4138f4b1d5216b2cd56958a381a0cb74b7670e7e67",
      "text": "嗯！\n……不过，主能赶来真是帮大忙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d3aa8eb2424f915fdb04d74b69618c68b7b45e70eadff05993f96174f36e9115",
      "text": "若仅吾与幼小之人独处，\n未免有些那个……放心不下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45aeff27515a61c69853a7e987fb95466d53242bd31fa8091763bf28c6c0f3cc",
      "text": "呐呐，大哥哥！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:926f6bc50b27894e1e11e234223f529c4d67ec1a38215400a74bd0a4a66be14b",
      "text": "哇！？……什、何事，幼小之人啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:be2d4ef98325b42f53b6884211c23ce8babddb6c4d1dd51af1316a98f0cdb41f",
      "text": "大哥哥，为什么\n肩膀上要放个毛绒玩偶啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a1815af7824b75f15bce73ea3cfbb3715f19617f840a7b1bcaa8d99fadad854",
      "text": "唔。此非玩偶！\n乃背负尘世之罪孽的堕天使，撒旦是也！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_c:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e0924285195940953dedfac96aabfc23624bf3e873c15e696bb929f692860bf9",
      "text": "哇……！\n撒旦好可爱哦！也借我玩玩嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:628d07b19dae14947041f3979b829bbdb9e9dcb3b06fb69769c45147e849a7da",
      "text": "！？……否、否也。撒旦与吾乃不可分割之命运。\n无法交托于汝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e52f54a1be4a0d685d6c8fbb6b72355bc1eb771829986410651aa8b542ba9f0",
      "text": "这样啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e70ac81ceea24bfd34e3ec1e0e7d82ec7b26e98174919b2c1218bdc48040f162",
      "text": "然……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aa51ec84439a2d7c0d7a2ba06beab8ea2896d4394506bdc92821dd05fe12dbbb",
      "text": "幼小之人啊，且在此稍候片刻。\n吾主，此地便托付于汝了。有劳照看此人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:554474fd0bcf2bfe062fc8966c856638d191d6e42e5346541d56a279e7d8ced6",
      "text": "好的，我知道了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000043:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9ff128eaeb9b853fea0eaaf5d109eb344c71c2a3b448492234190a8300d3b1b",
      "text": "过了一会儿……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96adb27f2922eda86f3db4a4d44693b0f2df731873e9af50b8e6b94be975ad49",
      "text": "……久等了，幼小之人啊。\n此食粮，赐予汝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1759513157b720b63cc28cdd7325dc0d1df3e36c679b2b74ae16d3106e20cb15",
      "text": "哇，是咖喱饭！\n这个难不成是撒旦的形状？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fefdca1ee4115aa5a92eb0e1310ddb4569be67fd66f02412f5fc11fae538ea2e",
      "text": "正是。虽不可将撒旦交予汝，\n但且将此食粮纳于腹中，心满意足吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95ac832dc97d88cd4ce402578bca6ab5cde734db85807fd1959c28bde725b94d",
      "text": "嗯……！谢谢大哥哥！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000009:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000011:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48b2c93375123b586065f931665d6e4568c34945c2933053233b5e40f384dbe3",
      "text": "我家孩子给您添麻烦了，\n实在是非常抱歉。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000013:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6046264ff3d2689a2e21d929e534f69c75c0306bf700a665e3b41be85ad523d1",
      "text": "哪里，请别介意。\n妈妈来接你了，太好了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:579332ce77b33a3dc7180cae5389a4621f9162cdae0b0db7a39e3c3606c6efa4",
      "text": "嗯！大哥哥，拜拜——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4e0c1f9f63867f0b67672128658ad75a04a52d5983672c09ceea0b7e9fed13ef",
      "text": "别了，幼小之人啊！\n切莫再次松开温暖之人的手。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4174110c533a064e350ad2d54b3d3756f2d550044147b4757e7b63b045d1246",
      "text": "……容吾重新致谢。\n吾主，汝之救济，吾由衷感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2b3b5f08db5b684836ddec86280bd62d75a75ca0bdbd400a37a156eb36c1b7c",
      "text": "哪里，多亏阿斯兰先生保护了他，\n那个孩子才能和妈妈团聚呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7b1517530db053853080c24a05fe4a5a4a1dd5eb9b123e4f96d96dbacf407aa",
      "text": "……对幼小之人而言，至亲乃伟岸之存在。\n若与之离散，自是会不安难耐……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97abffba5633f98f91b3765ffa3f8f16a6cd04b84aa0bd714a807aedb6202985",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5b5f49ad39ebd4f6f44accd0b67329623a3c22e0e69c45b61d176b0bee53272c",
      "text": "没、无甚大碍。\n那么……吾便重新出门采办食粮吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4d414e654e09a1f5343a17abd6795afd1b98cd8902c545622685455a01c3a7b4",
      "text": "是去采购食材对吧？\n我也来帮忙，阿斯兰先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_01_1_2_029_01:1_2_029_01_e:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ba2280064aaf5f085b2d51f3f36c4443699af6298a138c8fc87711700c2e70dd",
      "text": "感激不尽。吾主●●●●●●●●●●。\n来吧，同去将至上之供物收入囊中！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
